# Use the MTG deckbuilder MCP

Card text, prices, legality, and EDHREC numbers change. Memory is wrong often enough to matter. Look them up.

The server is `mtg-deckbuilder` (this repo: `mtg-mcp`). If its tools are not in the session, say so and stop. Do not invent the report.

## When a deck shows up

A new commander, or a paste, file, or Moxfield / Archidekt / MTGO link, runs the full deck pass. Get the list as text first (Moxfield has no public API; curl often gets blocked). Do not name a card until `get_card` confirms the oracle text, colour identity, and Commander legality. `get_card_rulings` if the line depends on timing. The pass runs NeRo, Defcat, and the Based 33-card school on the same list.

## How to search

Scryfall syntax, Commander-scoped:

```text
id<=ubr t:instant o:haste f:commander usd<5
```

`id<=` is the commander's colours. `f:commander` keeps illegal cards out.

## What to hand back

Use the block the full deck pass asks for. A new list leads with the bend, the turn, and the bar. An existing list leads with the one swap that fixes the plan, then at most four more, each tied to a number from `analyze_deck` or a combo from `find_combos`. Skip generic "add ramp and draw" if the report does not show that gap.
